      *<META C100-MANDATORY-FIELDS>                                     01670000
      *                                                                         
      *     Fin-Inst-No must be present                                         
      *                                                                         
           If  RTFCE100-I-Fin-Inst-No-I  Not = 'U'                              
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Fin-Inst-No-O         
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Fin-Inst-No'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-ANGI-FELT&'     To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
      *     Kontrakt-Type must be present                                       
      *                                                                         
           If  RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-I                                       
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Move  'F'                 To                                     
                                         RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-O             
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Kontrakt-Type'     To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-ANGI-FELT&'     To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
      *     Operasjons-Art must be present                                      
      *                                                                         
           If  RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-I                                      
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Move  'F'                 To                                     
                                         RTFCE100-I-Operation-Type-O            
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Operasjons-Art'    To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-MISSING-FIELD&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-If                                                               
      *</META>                                                          02020000
