      *################################################################*03150000
      * Test permitted values                                          *03160000
      *                                                                *03170000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*03180000
       C300-Permitted-Values             Section.                       03190000
      *                                                                 03200000
      *  This code is maintained by the codegenerator. Any user changes 03210000
      *  between the META tags will be lost. Any user code should be    03220000
      *  placed in the C310-... or C320... sections                     03230000
      *                                                                 03240000
      *<META C300-PERMITTED-VALUES>                                     03250000
      *                                                                         
      *    Kontrakt-Nr must be numeric if present.                              
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-I                                     
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-D                                     
                                         Not Numeric                            
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-B-Contract-No-O         
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Kontrakt-Nr'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Validating permitted values for Silent-Confirmation                  
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Silent-Confr-I                                    
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Silent-Confr-D                                    
                                         Not = 'Y'                              
              And  RTFCE100-I-Silent-Confr-D                                    
                                         Not = 'N'                              
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Silent-Confr-O        
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Silent-Confirmation'                                      
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Validating permitted values for Bekreftet/Ubekreftet                 
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-I                                       
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-D                                       
                                         Not = 'Y'                              
              And  RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-D                                       
                                         Not = 'N'                              
              And  RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-D                                       
                                         Not = 'M'                              
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Confirmed-O           
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Bekreftet/Ubekreftet'                                     
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Oppfølgningsdato must be numeric if present.                         
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-I                                  
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-D                                  
                                         Not Numeric                            
               Move  'F'                 To                                     
                                         RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-O            
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Oppfølgningsdato'  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
             When Other                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Oppfølgningsdato må inneholde gyldig dato.                           
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                R7919040-Validate-Date                 
               Set  R7919040-Version     To    True                             
               Move  RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-D                                
                                         To    R7919040-In-Date                 
               Call  'F7919040'          Using R7919040-Validate-Date           
                                               R7919999-Error                   
               End-Call                                                         
                                                                                
               If  Not R7919999-Return-Ok                                       
                   Move  'F'             To                                     
                                         RTFCE100-I-Follow-Up-Date-O            
                   Move  'FELT1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
                   Move  'Oppfølgningsdato'                                     
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
                   Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'                                    
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
                   Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                       
               End-If                                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Forfallsdato must be numeric if present.                             
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D Not Numeric                            
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-O            
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Forfallsdato'      To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
             When Other                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Forfallsdato må inneholde gyldig dato.                               
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                R7919040-Validate-Date                 
               Set  R7919040-Version     To    True                             
               Move  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-D                                      
                                         To    R7919040-In-Date                 
               Call  'F7919040'          Using R7919040-Validate-Date           
                                               R7919999-Error                   
               End-Call                                                         
                                                                                
               If  Not R7919999-Return-Ok                                       
                   Move  'F'             To    RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-O            
                   Move  'FELT1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
                   Move  'Forfallsdato'  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
                   Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'                                    
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
                   Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                       
               End-If                                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Utløpsdato must be numeric if present.                               
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-I                                     
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-D                                     
                                         Not Numeric                            
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-O         
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Utløpsdato'        To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
             When Other                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Utløpsdato må inneholde gyldig dato.                                 
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                R7919040-Validate-Date                 
               Set  R7919040-Version     To    True                             
               Move  RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-D                                   
                                         To    R7919040-In-Date                 
               Call  'F7919040'          Using R7919040-Validate-Date           
                                               R7919999-Error                   
               End-Call                                                         
                                                                                
               If  Not R7919999-Return-Ok                                       
                   Move  'F'             To    RTFCE100-I-Expiry-Date-O         
                   Move  'FELT1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
                   Move  'Utløpsdato'    To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
                   Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'                                    
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
                   Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                       
               End-If                                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Utstedt-Dato must be numeric if present.                             
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-I                                     
                                         Not = 'U'                              
               Continue                                                         
             When  RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-D                                     
                                         Not Numeric                            
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-O         
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
               Move  'Utstedt-Dato'      To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                           
             When Other                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Utstedt-Dato må inneholde gyldig dato.                               
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                R7919040-Validate-Date                 
               Set  R7919040-Version     To    True                             
               Move  RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-D                                   
                                         To    R7919040-In-Date                 
               Call  'F7919040'          Using R7919040-Validate-Date           
                                               R7919999-Error                   
               End-Call                                                         
                                                                                
               If  Not R7919999-Return-Ok                                       
                   Move  'F'             To    RTFCE100-I-Issued-Date-O         
                   Move  'FELT1'         To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)          
                   Move  'Utstedt-Dato'  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)         
                   Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'                                    
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code            
                   Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                       
               End-If                                                           
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *    Kontraktsbeløp must be numeric if present.                           
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When  RTFCE100-I-Orig-Amount-I                                     
                                         Not = 'U'                              
