      *                Move  'VAR1'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  08340000
      *                Move  'Forfallsdato eller forfallstid'           08350000
      *                                  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 08360000
      *                Move  'VAR2'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  08370000
      *                Move  'Avista'    To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 08380000
