      *                                                                 08470000
      *            If  RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-I Not = 'U'                  08480000
      *            And RTFCE100-I-Tenor-I    Not = 'U'                  08490000
      *                Move  'F'         To    RTFCE100-I-Due-Date-O    08500000
      *                Move  'FELT1'     To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  08510000
      *                Move  'Forfallsdato'                             08520000
      *                                  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 08530000
      *                Move  'FELT2'     To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  08540000
      *                Move  'Forfallstid'                              08550000
