                         Or RTFCE100-I-Contract-Type-D   = 'ECA ' )     08900000
                                                                        08910000
                   Move 'Forfallstid eller forfallsdato'                08920000
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 08930000
                   Move 'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  08940000
                   Move 'GL-ANGI-FELT&'  To    R400CH01-Message-Code    08950000
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                08960000
                                                                        08970000
                 When  RTFCE100-I-Orig-Amount-I Not = 'U'               08980000
                   Move 'F'              To    RTFCE100-I-Orig-Amount-O 08990000
                   Move 'Kontraktbeløp'  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 09000000
                   Move 'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  09010000
                   Move 'GL-ANGI-FELT&'  To    R400CH01-Message-Code    09020000
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                09030000
                                                                        09040000
                 When  RTFCE100-I-CC-Amount-I   Not = 'U'               09050000
                   Move 'F'              To    RTFCE100-I-Orig-Amount-O 09060000
                   Move 'Valutasort kontraktbeløp'                      09070000
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 09080000
                   Move 'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  09090000
                   Move 'GL-ANGI-FELT&'  To    R400CH01-Message-Code    09100000
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                09110000
                End-Evaluate                                            09120000
