                   Move 'Kontraktbeløp'  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 09310000
                   Move 'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  09320000
                   Move 'GL-ANGI-FELT&'  To    R400CH01-Message-Code    09330000
                   Perform Z700-Error-AE                                09340000
                                                                        09350000
                 When  RTFCE100-I-CC-Amount-I   Not = 'U'               09360000
