      *################################################################*11610000
      * Place code necessary to prepare control of input data against  *11620000
      * database fields later here. add Perform statements of other    *11630000
      * sections for your own logic here. Preferably seperate sections *11640000
      * for each database element to be read.                          *11650000
      *                                                                *11660000
      * REMEMBER !!! Use database interfaces. No direct read from this *11670000
      * module.                                                        *11680000
      *                                                                *11690000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*11700000
      *<META D000-PREPARE-DB-READ>                                      11710000
       D000-Prepare-DB-Read              Section.                       11720000
      *                                                                 11730000
      *</META>                                                          11740000
      *                                                                 11750000
           Continue                                                     11762000
      *                                                                 11770000
           .                                                            11780000
      *                                                                 11790000
